  "text": "Veterinary Oncology in Yonkers | Animal Specialty Center\nSkip to Primary Content\nBook\nContact Us\nMap\n9 Odell Plaza,\nYonkers,\nNY,\n10701\nCall\n(914) 457-4000\nEmergency\nEmergency\nPhone:\n(914) 457-4000\nAddress:\n9 Odell Plaza,\nYonkers,\nNY,\n10701\nOur Team\nServices\nCardiology\nDermatology\nEmergency\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nRadiation Oncology\nSurgery\nPet Owners\nReferring Veterinarians\nCareer Growth\nEmergency\nContact Us\nMedical\nOncology\nCancer Care Options for Your Pet at Animal Specialty Center\nYonkers Premier Animal Cancer Care Team:\nAt Animal Specialty Center, we understand how difficult a cancer diagnosis for your pet can be. Our compassionate medical oncology team is here to support you and your pet every step of the way. If you have been referred to our hospital or would like to schedule a consultation with one of our medical oncologists, call us to make an appointment.\nContact Us\nWhat is Veterinary Medical Oncology?\nVeterinary Medical Oncology focuses on the treatment of pets diagnosed with cancer by using chemotherapy, hormone therapy, targeted therapy, or immunotherapy. Our Medical Oncologists can help with the assessment, diagnosis, and treatment of cancers and secondary symptoms of cancer.\nMedical Oncology Treatments\nMedical Oncology is often used in conjunction with surgery, radiation oncology, internal medicine, and other treatment methods. The chemotherapy treatments that are used are the same as those used as the treatment of humans with cancer. Your pet’s customized treatment plan is administered, monitored, and managed by our highly skilled veterinary nurses within our hospital.\nOur Team\nAnimal Specialty Center\n9 Odell Plaza\nYonkers\n,\nNY\n10701\nT:\n(914) 457-4000\nF:\n(914) 457-4001\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nContact Us\nOur Team\nCareer Growth\nPet Owners\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
